Module demo.comparison.

Rule testGreaterThanOrEqual given x, y, produce:
  Return x is at least y.
Rule testLessThanOrEqual given x, y, produce:
  Return x is at most y.
Rule testNotEqual given x, y, produce:
  Return x not equal to y.
Rule testInRange given value, min, max, produce:
  Return value is at least min and value is at most max.
